+    <section anchor="relax-ng-compact-(rnc)-schema-for-svg-1.2-rfc" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-appendix.a">
+      <name slugifiedName="name-relax-ng-compact-(rnc)-schema-for-svg-1.2-rfc">RELAX NG Compact (RNC) Schema for SVG 1.2 RFC</name>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-1">The following RNC schema can be used to check whether an SVG file
+conforms to SVG 1.2 RFC.  For example, if this schema were contained
+in a file called SVG-1.2-RFC.rnc, the following command will test
+whether SVG file diagram.svg is a conformant SVG 1.2 RFC drawing.</t>
+      <sourcecode type="" markers="false" pn="section-appendix.a-2">
+jing -c SVG-1.2-RFC.rnc diagram.svg
+</sourcecode>
